  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Evidence in Governance and Politics (EGAP) network to generate, accumulate, and share evidence between scholars, practitioners and policymakers, in order to foster the development of innovative evaluation methods, develop global evaluation capacities, and improve the impact of evaluation evidence.</narrative>
